## 🚀 GitHub Actions Workflows

### 1. Maven Build and Test (`maven-build.yml`)
**Triggers**: Push to main/develop, Pull Requests

**Steps**:
- ✅ Set up Java 17 environment
- ✅ Build with Maven `mvn clean package`
- ✅ Run unit tests `mvn test`
- ✅ Upload test results as artifacts
- ✅ Upload built JAR file

**Status Badge**:
```
[Build Status] [Test Results] [Artifacts]
```

### 2. CodeQL Security Analysis (`codeql-analysis.yml`)
**Triggers**: Push, Pull Requests, Weekly schedule

**Steps**:
- ✅ Initialize CodeQL for Java
- ✅ Scan code for vulnerabilities
- ✅ Generate security reports
- ✅ Comment on PRs with findings

**Coverage**:
- ✅ SQL injection detection
- ✅ Cross-site scripting (XSS)
- ✅ Insecure cryptography
- ✅ Authentication issues
- ✅ Authorization flaws

### 3. Copilot Code Review (`copilot-review.yml`)
**Triggers**: Pull Requests to main/develop

**Steps**:
- ✅ Detect changed Java files
- ✅ Build changed code
- ✅ Perform code quality checks
- ✅ Post automated review comments
- ✅ Provide review checklist

**Review Checklist**:
- [ ] Code follows project conventions
- [ ] No hardcoded sensitive data
- [ ] Proper error handling
- [ ] Unit tests added/updated
- [ ] Documentation updated

