mvn test -X

# Check test logs
cat target/surefire-reports/
```

### Port Already in Use
```bash
# Change port in application.properties
server.port=8081

# Or kill process on port 8080
lsof -i :8080
kill -9 <PID>
```

### Git Conflicts
