### Stash Work
```bash
# Save work temporarily
git stash

# List stashes
git stash list

# Restore work
git stash pop
```

### Check What Changed
```bash
# Between branches
git diff develop..feature/my-feature

# Specific file
git diff feature/my-feature -- src/file.java
```

### Revert Mistakes
```bash
# Undo last commit (keep changes)
git reset --soft HEAD~1

# Undo last commit (discard changes)
git reset --hard HEAD~1

# Undo specific file
git checkout HEAD -- file.java
```

