4. **Pull Request Template** - Standardized PR format

### ✅ Complete Code Organization
- 19 Java source files (controllers, services, models, repos)
- 2 Test files with comprehensive test cases
- Proper Spring Boot layer architecture
- 17 REST API endpoints ready to use

### ✅ Comprehensive Documentation
10 detailed guides covering setup, development, APIs, and workflows

